     <p style="font-family: ˎ̥;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;">
</p><p style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 黑体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>一、布置时间</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">月5日（周三）中午。</span></p><p style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 黑体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>二、需要布置的班级 </strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高一5</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">-16</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">班布置本班教室，各层自修教室由劳动课包干打扫的班级布置。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高二1</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">-16</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">班除布置本班教室外，1</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">-5</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">楼各自修教室由劳动课包干打扫的班级布置。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">106</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、3</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">108</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">由考务组布置。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">请班主任下班指导本班学生</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">进行试场布置,</span><span style="font-family: ˎ̥;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">等考务组验收通过后才能离开</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>。</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 黑体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 黑体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>三、布置的具体要求如下:</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>1、  做到“</strong></span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>六</strong></span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>清”</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>地面清</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">：搞好教室卫生，地上无纸屑。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>墙面清</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">：墙上所有</span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>文字</strong></span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>和图画</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">都要清除</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，实在无法清除的</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">用厚纸覆盖</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>覆盖</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>要牢固、整齐</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。覆盖</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">纸</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">到教学处（家贤楼1</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: ˎ̥;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">114</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）领取。软板帘子拉下，</span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>教室内的时钟全部摘下，放在讲台上，供监考教师参考。</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>桌面清</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">：桌面要求无任何文字，挑选桌面平整的</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，桌脚不摇晃</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">课桌做考试课桌。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>桌内清</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">：课桌内</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">课桌</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">下</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">清理干净。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>柜内清：教室南面和后面的</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">柜子可以放</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>少量东西</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，柜门要</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>关严</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>不要放会发出声音的物品（如闹钟）</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。柜门</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>有图案的</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">要</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">用厚纸覆盖</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。教室里的花盆放在走廊靠近扶栏排成一排，多余的请放到西边厕所门口或者东侧走廊。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>讲台清：</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">讲台上除时钟、电脑外其余物品请收好，</span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>电脑要将屏幕转向外侧</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，讲台内插线板的电源关掉。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>2、  课桌排列。</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（1）教室内放5排课桌,均匀排列如下</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（单人单桌）</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>。</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: ˎ̥;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>课