: left;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（3）余下的桌椅，放教室外</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">靠墙，</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">并排两列。摆放要整齐、安全。</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">桌面上不能放东西（图</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: ˎ̥;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">），凳子放在桌子下面（为使排列更紧密，凳子放在桌腿横梁上悬空，图</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: ˎ̥;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>3、贴好</strong></span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>桌贴。</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（1）桌贴</span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> 5日上午</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">到家贤楼一楼1</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">114</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教学处领取，按上图顺序贴好数字桌贴。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.02in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（2）门贴由考务组统一贴</span></p><p style="font-family: ˎ̥;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: ˎ̥;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>4</strong></span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>、每班布置完成后，</strong></span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>班主任负责把关，留至少3位学生在教室，</strong></span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>等考务组检查验收</strong></span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: ˎ̥;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>。</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: ˎ̥;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2022\1\202201050752275226.Jpeg" style="width: 419.25pt; height: 135.75pt" alt="202201050752277886.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2022\1\202201050752271279.Jpeg" style="width: 413.25pt; height: 132.75pt" alt="202201050752271070.Jpeg" /></span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span></p><p style="font-family: ˎ̥;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #FF0000;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span></p>
    
